#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:6
msgid "$lenmulti"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$lenmulti(name[,separator])**"
msgstr "用法：**$lenmulti(name[,separator])**"

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:9
msgid "Category: multi-value"
msgstr "类别：多值"

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:13
msgid "Returns the number of elements in the multi-value variable ``name``. A literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for ``name``, using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued variable. If ``name`` is missing ``$lenmulti`` will return \"0\". If ``separator`` is specified but left blank (e.g. ``$setmulti(A; B; C,)``) the function will return \"1\"."
msgstr ""
"返回多值变量 ``name`` 中的元素数量。可以使用 ``name`` 来代替表示多值的字面值"
"，使用 ``separator``（如果没有传递，则使用分号后跟空格 \"; \"）将值强制转换为"
"适当的多值变量。如果 ``name`` 缺失 ``$lenmulti`` 将返回 \"0\"。如果 "
"``separator`` 指定但留空（例如 ``$setmulti(A; B; C,)``）函数将返回 \"1\"。"

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:16
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_lenmulti.rst:18
msgid "The following statements will return the values indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将返回指示的值："
